@ 37.2.6.4 - Proto-Dhegiha to Quapaw
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Wolff, Hans (1950), “Comparative Siouan I”. International Journal of American Linguistics 16(2):61 – 66; Wolff, Hans (1950), “Comparative Siouan II” International Journal of American Linguistics 16(3):113 – 121; Wolff, Hans (1950), “Comparative Siouan III”. International Journal of American Linguistics 16(4):168 – 178; and cedh audmanh’s changes above, which assisted me in deciphering the vintage phonetic transcription scheme
	p > {p,b,m,w} / _C
	tʲ > ʃ
	L > d / #_
	x > ʒ (*)
	Lʲ > j / #_õ (*)
	Lʲ > t / #_ã (*)
	ã > õ (*)
	ũ > ã / stressed (*)
	m > ∅ / #_n (in morphemes) (*)